# Where you put the CPython tarball that `appify.sh --embed` bundles. ~25MB
# each, and a binary, so it must never be committed.
#
# NC-137: the tarballs are placed here by hand. There is no fetch, no pin and no
# checksum anywhere in appify.sh — the build deliberately never touches the
# network, and you download the tarball once yourself. A note saying otherwise
# would make a fresh clone silently produce a smaller bundle than the README
# promises.
#
# NC-225: the build also keeps the interpreter it prepared from that tarball
# here (prepared-*/, about 54MB each, the two newest), so later builds copy it in
# as a clone instead of preparing it again.
.cache/

# Build output (also covered by the repo-root .gitignore; kept here belt-and-
# braces so a build run from inside packaging/ can't accidentally stage it).
dist/

.DS_Store
